---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Us — Tornado Spinner | Arcade Inventors, LLC"
      description="TornadoSpinner.com is a property of Arcade Inventors, LLC — arcade design and manufacturing in Indianapolis, Indiana.">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h2 class="chrome">A property of Arcade Inventors, LLC</h2>
        <p class="lede">The Tornado Spinner was something never before seen in the arcade world: an
          ultra-smooth spinner, designed from scratch for retro gaming rather than adapted from something
          else. Every component has been meticulously designed within strict guidelines — by gamers, for
          gamers. It is made entirely in the United States.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feat" style="margin-top:8px">
        <div class="card"><span class="n">Trust</span><h3>Four decades of arcade experience</h3>
          <p>Arcade Inventors, LLC is composed of passionate video game aficionados with a combined
            experience of 40 years. What started as a successful OEM has become one of the most successful
            video game part design and manufacturing operations of its kind. We understand what you need
            from your arcade parts, because we have been avid gamers like you.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="n">Customers</span><h3>Retro gamers and leading OEMs</h3>
          <p>Our customers are retro arcade gamers and some of the industry's leading OEMs. Every customer
            is given the same high level of attention from dedicated representatives, and you get the
            benefit of dealing with a US-headquartered company.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="n">Results</span><h3>Relationships that run past ten years</h3>
          <p>Our design and manufacturing services are built around service and cost reduction, which is
            what makes the relationships last. Typical customer relationships exceed ten years — our
            customers are our best reference. We are small enough to be nimble and flexible, and
            experienced enough to get it right.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:34px">
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to us</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/gallery/">See the gallery</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
